al titans from around the world in theatrical, over-the-top encounters full of style and unleash flashy power moves, and engage in collaborative link attacks with your crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758980/extras/769198479d3d2011efa01e601edd4276.poster.avif?t=1749786794\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758980/extras/769198479d3d2011efa01e601edd4276.webm?t=1749786794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758980/extras/769198479d3d2011efa01e601edd4276.mp4?t=1749786794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize Your Tour Van \u2013 Travel the world in your trusty tour van, upgrade it as the story goes, and uncover rival bands.</p></li></ul>",
